<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Tacaynamo</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Tacaynamo is the legendary founder of the ruling dynasty of Chimor on the north coast of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peru">Peru</a>. According to a tradition recorded by the Spanish, he arrived by sea on a raft of logs, settled in the Moche valley and founded the dynasty at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chan-chan">Chan Chan</a>, the Chimú capital. His successors are said to have extended the kingdom along the coast.</p></div>
